    "body": "Fixed the review feedback:\n\n1. **Header row width**: The scope line now shows only the post name (e.g. `Fanuc (built-in)`) in the header row, with the full path revealed on hover via a tooltip. This keeps the header width stable regardless of checkout path length, so the Operations tab click always lands.\n\n2. **Pinning test**: Updated `post_dialog_shows_the_shipped_post_path` to assert on the post name only — no longer depends on checkout path length.\n\n3. **Cleanup**: Removed the stray blank line at the end of `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`.\n\nReady for re-check.\n",
