    "body": "Fixed the remaining review feedback:\r\n\r\n1. **Clippy error fixed**: Changed `format!(\"{post_label}\")` to `post_label.to_string()` — `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` is clean.\r\n\r\n2. **Screenshots**:\r\n   - Post dialog scope line shows `Fanuc (built-in)` (header stays narrow regardless of checkout path length)\r\n   - Hover over the post name shows the full path tooltip (e.g. `C:\\...\\assets\\posts\\fanuc.cps`)\r\n   - Captured from the running GUI \r\n<img width=\"1728\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"camcraft-post-dialog\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f25222fa-b72f-488c-a9fc-984e33389e95\" />\r\n and \r\n<img width=\"1728\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"camcraft-post-dialog-hover\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/85de5c63-5bd8-4437-8030-adb2d87e7068\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n3. **Pinning test** (`post_dialog_shows_the_shipped_post_path`): asserts on the post name only — path length independent.\r\n\r\nReady for re-check.\r\n",
